# Keep the Docker build context (and therefore the published image) free of
# machine-local and unrelated files.
#
# .cargo/ is excluded on purpose: a per-developer .cargo/config.toml often
# contains machine-specific settings (e.g. a regional crates.io mirror,
# custom linkers). The image must build from crates.io defaults so that it is
# reproducible for users worldwide.
#
# NOTE: the Dockerfile must not COPY ./.cargo/ -- docker refuses to copy a
# path that is excluded here.
.cargo/

# Local Nix / direnv developer environment
.envrc
.direnv/

# Build output
target/

# Version control data
.git/
.github/

# Editor / workspace settings
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local scratch data that must never ship inside the image
.backup/
tests/
docs/

# Docs and metadata are not needed to compile
*.md
LICENSE
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# OS clutter
**/Thumbs.db
**/.DS_Store
**/*~
